your brand in minutes to uncover the blind spots and turn them into opportunities.","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","link","4",{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://kota.co.uk/brand-pulse","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","6",{"property":"og:locale","content":"en_US","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","8",{"property":"og:type","content":"article","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","10",{"property":"og:title","content":"Brand Pulse - KOTA","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","12",{"property":"og:description","content":"Brand expectations change fast. Audit your brand in minutes to uncover the blind spots and turn them into opportunities.","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","14",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://kota.co.uk/brand-pulse/","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","16",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"KOTA","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","18",{"property":"article:publisher","content":"https://www.facebook.com/kotacreative/","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","20",{"property":"article:modified_time","content":"2025-03-11T16:43:19+00:00","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","22",{"property":"og:image","content":"https://content.kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/03/kota-social-sharing.jpg","children":"$undefined"}],"\n\t",["$","meta","24",{"property":"og:image:width","content":"1200","children":"$undefined"}],"\n\t",["$","meta","26",{"property":"og:image:height","content":"675","children":"$undefined"}],"\n\t",["$","meta","28",{"property":"og:image:type","content":"image/jpeg","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","30",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","meta","32",{"name":"twitter:site","content":"@kotacreative","children":"$undefined"}],"\n",["$","script","34",{"type":"application/ld+json","className":"yoast-schema-graph","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$17"},"children":"$undefined"}],"\n"]],["$","section",null,{"className":"BrandPulse_page__QMKGz","children":["$","$L18",null,{"data":{"hero":{"heading":"Brand Pulse Audit Tool","text":"<p>Ready to check your brand’s pulse? Dive in to see where your brand is thriving, and where it needs a little CPR.</p>\n"},"questions":[{"heading":"Brand Positioning","slug":"brand-positioning","question":"<p>Is your strategy sharp? Do you know your brand mission, your guiding principles, and your value propositions for each audience?</p>\n","greatAnswer":"You’re cutting through the noise with precision. Keep refining and building on your clear message to stay at the top.","needsWorkAnswer":"Your brand’s message is coming through, but it’s a little fuzzy. Time to sharpen up and tighten that positioning for more impact.","poorAnswer":"Blending in is your brand’s biggest enemy. Let’s clarify what makes you different and bring that into the spotlight."},{"heading":"Tone of voice","slug":"tone-of-voice","question":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">If you have a brand, you have a tone of voice—whether you realise it or not. It’s in the language you use consistently and the vibe that brings. Do you have this clearly-defined somewhere?</span><!-- notionvc: 40a10208-7a00-45d3-935e-5beed61d72db --></p>\n","greatAnswer":"Your tone is spot-on, capturing your brand’s personality perfectly. Keep speaking with confidence and clarity.","needsWorkAnswer":"Your voice is coming through, but it’s inconsistent. Time to refine your tone and let it shine across every touchpoint.","poorAnswer":"It’s time to inject some personality. Let's make sure your voice feels distinct and true to your brand."},{"heading":"Logo mark","slug":"logo-mark","question":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Your logo should embody the heart of your brand and work seamlessly across both digital and print. Does it need an evolution or a complete refresh?</span><!-- notionvc: aba854c2-5107-40dc-b720-a2fc8ac329ab --></p>\n","greatAnswer":"Your logo is strong, memorable, and representing your brand like a pro. Keep it sharp, and you’ll continue turning heads.","needsWorkAnswer":"Your logo’s on the right track but could use a refresh to stay relevant. Let’s fine-tune the details.","poorAnswer":"Your logo’s not doing you any favours. It’s time for a redesign to make sure your brand is represented with impact."},{"heading":"Fonts & colours","slug":"fonts-colours","question":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Your brand colour and fonts might have solid recognition, but that doesn’t mean it can’t feel stale after a while. Is it time to introduce a more robust supporting palette to keep things fresh?</span><!-- notionvc: 74f838d9-f3c7-4b8f-bb98-f23301ba72b9 --></p>\n","greatAnswer":"Your fonts and colours are pulling together beautifully to represent your brand. Keep the consistency, and you’ll remain cohesive.","needsWorkAnswer":"Your style choices are good, but they could use a little refinement. Time to bring in more harmony and balance.","poorAnswer":"Your fonts and colours need a complete overhaul. Let’s make sure your visual identity is sending the right message."},{"heading":"Brand visuals","slug":"brand-visuals","question":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Brand visuals—whether it’s imagery, graphics, or animations—are what bring your brand to life. Do you have a stash somewhere that still packs a punch, or are you running on empty?</span><!-- notionvc: 96da3fe3-fb6e-44bd-9f2f-48b64df1deb6 --></p>\n","greatAnswer":"Your visuals tell a compelling story and spark connection. Keep up the good work, and don’t be afraid to evolve with your audience.","needsWorkAnswer":"Your visuals are good but not quite great. Let’s bring in a little more emotion and personality.","poorAnswer":"If your visuals aren’t making an impact, it’s time to reimagine how they can better tell your brand’s story."},{"heading":"Guidelines","slug":"guidelines","question":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Are your brand guidelines solid enough to keep everything looking sharp? Are they tucked away in a dusty PDF, or do they live online as a dynamic toolkit with downloadable assets?</span><!-- notionvc: 45c223f0-9018-4edc-a1d6-131c5c2be7da --></p>\n","greatAnswer":"Your guidelines are strong and ensure your brand stays consistent everywhere. Keep them updated, and you’ll always stay cohesive.","needsWorkAnswer":"You’ve got guidelines, but they could use a little more clarity. Tighten them up to make sure everyone’s on the same page.","poorAnswer":"Your guidelines are all over the place, or maybe you don’t have any! Time to put together a solid framework to keep your brand aligned."},{"heading":"Website copy","slug":"website-copy","question":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Is your website copy fresh and ready to roll? If it&#8217;s not resonating or driving action, it’s probably time for a refresh. </span><!-- notionvc: 10450a83-822d-4a26-a04a-729ad732d38b --></p>\n","greatAnswer":"Your website copy connects, engages, and delivers your message clearly. Keep the storytelling strong and your audience will keep coming back.","needsWorkAnswer":"Your web copy’s on the right path but needs a bit more punch. Time to refine it so it speaks louder and clearer.","poorAnswer":"If your copy isn’t hitting home, it’s time to rethink your messaging. Let’s make sure your words pack the right punch."}],"results":{"level1":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Your brand’s pulse is faint, but the good news is you’ve got nowhere to go but up! It’s time for a fresh look at the essentials. Start from the ground up and breathe some life into your brand. The potential is there—let’s unlock it.</span><!-- notionvc: 0781d34d-0f90-4807-b71b-c18b9664edb4 --></p>\n","level2":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">You’re on the right path, but your brand’s got some work to do. It’s not quite there yet, but with a few key tweaks and a little focus, you’ll see things start to click. Don’t sweat it—small changes can make a big impact.</span><!-- notionvc: ea9c062f-3a6a-41af-88cd-ef9e05dda199 --></p>\n","level3":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Your brand is solid, but it could use a bit more spark. You’re doing some things well, but there’s room to level up and make a stronger impression. A little fine-tuning, and you’ll be turning heads in no time.</span><!-- notionvc: 7da6aa8e-92e0-4689-a0bf-b768cc28cd5f --></p>\n","level4":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">You’ve got a strong brand, no doubt about it. Now, it’s all about maintaining that momentum and refining the details. Keep things consistent, fresh, and true to your vision, and your brand will continue to shine.</span><!-- notionvc: 9ec6e97c-fa43-4638-b648-598761f47689 --></p>\n","level5":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Your brand is firing on all cylinders! You’ve nailed it across the board, and it shows. Keep doing what you’re doing—just don’t forget to stay ahead of the curve and keep evolving to maintain that top spot.</span><!-- notionvc: 063dc696-56f9-4f13-b4cd-0c4d7a79dfb0 --></p>\n"},"relatedProjects":[{"title":"Florence","slug":"florence","databaseId":4926,"singleProject":{"projectDetails":{"yearCompleted":"2024","featuredImage":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/hero-1400x788.png 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/hero-2000x1126.png 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/hero-500x281.png 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/hero-768x432.png 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/hero-1536x865.png 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/hero-2048x1153.png 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/hero.png","mediaDetails":{"width":2448,"height":1378}},"featuredVideo":null},"hero":{"heading":"Inside Florence's stunning brand and digital transformation."}},"taxonomyServices":{"edges":[{"node":{"slug":"branding","name":"Branding"}},{"node":{"slug":"web-design-development","name":"Web design & development"}}]},"taxonomySectors":{"edges":[{"node":{"slug":"healthcare","name":"Healthcare"}}]}},{"title":"Tangerine","slug":"tangerine","databaseId":1148,"singleProject":{"projectDetails":{"yearCompleted":"2023","featuredImage":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/01/tangerine-thumbnail-1-1400x788.jpg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/01/tangerine-thumbnail-1-500x281.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/01/tangerine-thumbnail-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/01/tangerine-thumbnail-1.jpg 1440w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/01/tangerine-thumbnail-1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1440,"height":810}},"featuredVideo":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/01/tangerine-thumbnail2.mp4"}},"hero":{"heading":"We took on the challenge of creating the new website for tangerine, a global pioneer in design."}},"taxonomyServices":{"edges":[{"node":{"slug":"web-design-development","name":"Web design & development"}}]},"taxonomySectors":{"edges":[{"node":{"slug":"agencies","name":"Agencies"}}]}}]}}]}]]
